      "description": "A smiling man with Down syndrome, wearing a dark blue polo shirt, is the central subject of the image. His expression is cheerful and engaging, and he is looking directly at the camera. The text overlay \"the name's bob... bob\" reinforces the stereotype of infantilization and perceived simplicity associated with ableism.",
