      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "ableism_insurance_pity_narrative",
      "label": "Ableism Insurance Pity Narrative",
      "description": "The trope of portraying individuals with disabilities as pitiable or in need of pity, often used to elicit sympathy or to justify societal exclusion. This is implicitly referenced by the infantilizing and simplistic portrayal in the meme, which may be intended to evoke pity rather than respect.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
